      <div class="tg-involvement-layout"><div class="tg-involvement-layout"><div  class="tg-involvement-layout tg-involvement-type">
      <span class="tg-involvement-type">[Re]</span>
      </div><div class="tg-involvement-layout tg-involvement-body"><a target="_blank" href="https://t.me/bupt_moe" title="Telegram PeerChannel handle: bupt_moe" data-title="tg:bupt_moe">bupt.moe</a>

    <span class="tg-timestamp">2022-08-22T22:22:24+08:00</span>

    <div class="tg-white-space-preserve white-space-preserve tg-msg">#Windows
把 Win11 的右键菜单恢复成老版，重启explorer.exe生效
<code>reg.exe add "HKCU\Software\Classes\CLSID\{86ca1aa0-34aa-4e8b-a509-50c905bae2a2}\InprocServer32" /f /ve
</code>回滚命令: <code>reg.exe delete "HKCU\Software\Classes\CLSID\{86ca1aa0-34aa-4e8b-a509-50c905bae2a2}" /f

</code>更正：之前的消息里 CLSID 后面少了一个 \，麻烦各位看到的如果转发了补上这个

2026-11-12 更新： 此技巧已在 26300.9974 已失效。</div>
      </div></div></div>

    <span class="tg-timestamp">2026-11-12T17:02:54+08:00</span>

    <div class="tg-white-space-preserve white-space-preserve tg-msg">#windows
26H2把这个方法毙了，有两个解决办法：
1. 按住Shift再右键，还是传统菜单，或者
2. 去下vivetool，然后执行 <code>vivetool /disable /id:60813048</code> ，接着再修改注册表</div>
    </div></div>
